	"data": "Cyberspace V1 — Multi-User Persistent Digital Home\n\nThe room is the computer. The space is the app. You are not alone in it.\n\nVision\n\nCyberspace is a persistent digital home — a place you visit, inhabit, and share with others. Not a launcher, not a menu, not a 2D dashboard with a 3D coat of paint. A space with walls and floors and objects that mean something. You walk in, you see who's there, you interact with things together. It feels like showing up at a friend's apartment.\n\nThe lineage is…",
